WEBVTT

00:00:53.153 --> 00:00:56.919
Arusu ends up being present for the
destruction of the Magical Realm...

00:00:57.023 --> 00:01:00.960
...and the warlocks find out that she's
the one with the True Book of Spells.

00:01:01.628 --> 00:01:04.689
Meanwhile, Atelia blames
the destruction of the realm...

00:01:04.798 --> 00:01:07.062
...on the warlocks and declares war.

00:01:07.167 --> 00:01:09.499
But the warlocks launched
a full-scale attack...

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:11.934
...to retrieve the True Book of Spells.

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:16.740
Finally, it's an all-out war
between them.

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:50.137
Tweeny Witches

00:02:54.674 --> 00:02:59.134
The True Book of Spells

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:03.980
Let there be glory for the
long-established Witch Realm!

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:05.643
Let there be glory!

00:03:05.852 --> 00:03:08.253
That's Atelia?

00:03:12.859 --> 00:03:15.351
Find the True Book of Spells!

00:03:15.528 --> 00:03:17.826
Find those apprentice witches!

00:03:18.131 --> 00:03:19.690
This realm is...

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:24.064
This Magical Realm might
be destroyed, you know!

00:03:24.871 --> 00:03:27.431
This is no time to be fighting!

00:03:27.574 --> 00:03:29.372
Aren't we supposed to protect...

00:03:29.475 --> 00:03:32.206
...the Magical Realm by
working with the warlocks?

00:03:32.312 --> 00:03:35.111
They're trying to get
the True Book of Spells!

00:03:35.748 --> 00:03:40.310
You have to flee in order to
protect the True Book of Spells!

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:41.410
I---

00:03:41.688 --> 00:03:42.883
I---

00:03:43.356 --> 00:03:48.624
| really don't want others to get
hurt by the magic that I truly love!

00:03:48.828 --> 00:03:49.727
Arusu!

00:03:50.363 --> 00:03:51.125
Arusu!

00:03:51.197 --> 00:03:51.959
Arusu!

00:03:52.065 --> 00:03:53.032
Look out!

00:03:56.569 --> 00:03:57.502
Grandma?

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:02.999
It's because of this book...

00:04:03.943 --> 00:04:06.844
This is all because of this book!

00:04:07.113 --> 00:04:09.013
It can't be her...

00:04:09.315 --> 00:04:12.876
Arusu is here in this realm
with the True Book of Spells?

00:04:12.952 --> 00:04:15.011
You know Arusu?

00:04:15.288 --> 00:04:17.620
Of course I do. She is...

00:04:20.727 --> 00:04:23.822
But you said you're
looking for your son...

00:04:24.931 --> 00:04:26.558
Unbelievable!

00:04:36.809 --> 00:04:41.042
The True Book of Spells!
It's resonating with her anger!

00:04:41.247 --> 00:04:42.544
Arusu!

00:04:46.719 --> 00:04:49.620
There she is! The girl with
the True Book of Spells!

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:51.857
Dragon!

00:04:56.262 --> 00:04:57.457
Arusu!

00:05:04.604 --> 00:05:05.571
Lennon...

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:11.720
Eva! A shield!

00:05:11.744 --> 00:05:12.540
Eva! A shield!
Okay!

00:05:12.679 --> 00:05:16.616
Bike, barbecue beef,
take a shower!

00:05:22.622 --> 00:05:23.646
Lennon!

00:05:24.791 --> 00:05:26.122
It's just a scratch.

00:05:29.796 --> 00:05:30.888
Sheila?

00:05:34.233 --> 00:05:36.065
You'll protect the magic, right?

00:05:36.169 --> 00:05:38.035
Magic creates miracles, right?

00:05:38.137 --> 00:05:39.229
I know.

00:05:39.806 --> 00:05:41.417
Everything will be destroyed!

00:05:41.441 --> 00:05:43.205
Everything will be destroyed!
I know that too.

00:05:43.776 --> 00:05:46.768
Then why did you do that
with the True Book of Spells?

00:05:46.879 --> 00:05:49.905
But the reason the warlocks came...

00:05:50.016 --> 00:05:52.576
...is because I had
this book with me, right?

00:05:53.553 --> 00:05:55.647
If I didn't have this book with me...

00:05:55.755 --> 00:05:58.622
...Qoo's grandma wouldn't
have ended up like this!

00:05:58.791 --> 00:06:03.319
If I didn't come to this realm
with this book...

00:06:04.497 --> 00:06:09.628
...then the two of you wouldn't
have this Curse of Eternal Youth!

00:06:10.002 --> 00:06:11.513
I'm the one who called out to you.

00:06:11.537 --> 00:06:12.368
I'm the one who called out to you.
What?

00:06:13.172 --> 00:06:14.936
It's not your fault.

00:06:18.778 --> 00:06:22.146
Qoo, I don't know what to say...

00:06:22.281 --> 00:06:24.113
It's not your fault, Arusu.

00:06:24.884 --> 00:06:29.412
| was surprised to find out that
you came from the Human Realm...

00:06:29.856 --> 00:06:33.451
...but I'm really glad
that I met you, Arusu.

00:06:33.526 --> 00:06:36.860
Me too. I really feel that way too.

00:06:36.963 --> 00:06:37.623
Eva.

00:06:37.764 --> 00:06:40.461
If you didn't show up here, Arusu...

00:06:40.566 --> 00:06:43.399
...then I wouldn't have
known the importance...

00:06:43.569 --> 00:06:46.664
...of magic, or how important
it is to keep it alive.

00:06:46.906 --> 00:06:49.000
| hate to say it, but she's right.

00:06:49.108 --> 00:06:50.007
Sheila.

00:06:50.443 --> 00:06:53.708
So smile like you always do, okay?

00:06:55.548 --> 00:06:58.848
Eva, can you help me
collect some medicinal herbs?

00:06:58.951 --> 00:06:59.577
Okay!

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:01.910
Qoo.

00:07:02.755 --> 00:07:07.921
| know you're worried, but
you just have to move on.

00:07:08.895 --> 00:07:13.196
Even if you can't move forward right now,
you need to just keep looking ahead.

00:07:13.366 --> 00:07:17.428
No matter what happens, you must
not give that book to the warlocks.

00:07:18.771 --> 00:07:21.399
The warlocks...
Grande is trying to get his hand...

00:07:21.507 --> 00:07:24.670
...on the True Book of Spells
and the 100 species of fairies...

00:07:24.777 --> 00:07:27.109
...to use dark magic.

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:28.475
Dark magic?

00:07:28.614 --> 00:07:31.345
It's a magic of darkness
that destroys everything.

00:07:31.451 --> 00:07:33.715
But what for?

00:07:34.086 --> 00:07:38.614
That's the only way to avoid
the destruction of the realm.

00:07:38.758 --> 00:07:39.850
Avoid?

00:07:40.226 --> 00:07:43.093
But you said dark magic
destroys everything.

00:07:43.196 --> 00:07:44.960
Not only this realm...

00:07:45.064 --> 00:07:48.796
They plan to destroy the other realm
so that they can move there.

00:07:48.901 --> 00:07:50.479
The other realm?

00:07:50.503 --> 00:07:53.200
The other realm?
The Human Realm. Where you're from.

00:07:53.306 --> 00:07:54.239
What?

00:07:54.874 --> 00:07:58.401
That's why he entrusted it to you.
Your father, that is.

00:07:59.445 --> 00:08:03.279
He gave the True Book to you,
living in the Human Realm...

00:08:03.382 --> 00:08:05.851
...So the warlocks couldn't
get their hands on it.

00:08:05.952 --> 00:08:07.317
Entrusted.

00:08:08.354 --> 00:08:11.255
Dad gave this to me?

00:08:12.992 --> 00:08:14.756
Do you believe in magic?

00:08:14.827 --> 00:08:17.353
Yes! I'm gonna get on a broom
and fly in the sky.

00:08:17.463 --> 00:08:20.023
Well then, you'd better keep
that belief in a safe place.

00:08:20.132 --> 00:08:21.065
Belief?

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:23.430
That's right. A heart that believes.

00:08:23.536 --> 00:08:27.530
As long as you believe with all your heart,
anyone can use magic, you know.

00:08:30.443 --> 00:08:31.410
Dad.

00:08:37.283 --> 00:08:38.648
What's wrong?

00:08:41.888 --> 00:08:42.787
Hey!

00:08:44.924 --> 00:08:47.791
Eva, do you know light magic?

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.428
Light magic?

00:08:49.529 --> 00:08:52.089
Yeah, Wil told me about it.

00:08:52.365 --> 00:08:56.029
No matter what happens,
don't let the power of magic die out!

00:08:56.202 --> 00:09:00.901
The only magic capable of destroying
the dark magic is the light magic.

00:09:01.407 --> 00:09:03.739
I never heard of it, but...

00:09:04.877 --> 00:09:07.471
Wow! Your back is so smooth, Arusu!

00:09:07.647 --> 00:09:09.376
Well, yeah...

00:09:09.615 --> 00:09:13.017
That's because I'm still in my teens!
I have such youthful skin!

00:09:13.119 --> 00:09:15.110
| didn't mean it that way.

00:09:15.221 --> 00:09:18.521
Usually a witch has marks
of wings on her back.

00:09:18.791 --> 00:09:19.301
See?

00:09:19.325 --> 00:09:21.123
You're right!

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:25.158
So, what? Witches used to fly
in the air with their wings?

00:09:25.565 --> 00:09:28.364
That's right. Oh, and the warlocks too.

00:09:28.534 --> 00:09:31.401
We're talking long, long ago.

00:09:31.904 --> 00:09:33.303
Why is that?

00:09:33.539 --> 00:09:39.171
Sheila said they couldn't go on
living with wings for some reason...

00:09:40.179 --> 00:09:41.237
Arusu?

00:09:41.414 --> 00:09:46.045
You evolved from the same life form,
so why must you fight?

00:09:46.152 --> 00:09:47.449
Life form?

00:09:47.553 --> 00:09:52.013
Ah, sorry about that.
We humans have marks of a tail.

00:09:52.124 --> 00:09:55.424
That's interesting!
I didn't know you had a tail!

00:09:55.561 --> 00:09:58.690
Oh, stop it!
You just imagined me having a tail!

00:10:00.967 --> 00:10:02.696
But I'm relieved.

00:10:02.835 --> 00:10:05.236
You seem much better now, Arusu.

00:10:05.371 --> 00:10:06.429
Eva.

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:08.703
Thanks.

00:10:09.809 --> 00:10:13.905
How come you know about Arusu's father?

00:10:15.348 --> 00:10:17.146
I'll do it for you.

00:10:18.918 --> 00:10:22.013
It's because Arusu and |
are mirrors of each other.

00:10:22.421 --> 00:10:24.116
I told you before, didn't 1?

00:10:24.223 --> 00:10:26.692
But that doesn't explain anything.

00:10:26.926 --> 00:10:27.757
You!

00:10:28.794 --> 00:10:30.421
It can't be!

00:10:30.563 --> 00:10:33.692
Let me get on board!
Let me go to the Human Realm!

00:10:33.833 --> 00:10:37.633
| don't want to die in the destruction!
Let me get on board!

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:41.497
People are surging towards
the Port of Departure.

00:10:41.707 --> 00:10:44.642
Bring me Sheila and those four.

00:10:45.111 --> 00:10:46.408
Four?

00:10:46.545 --> 00:10:50.948
I thought it was just Sheila's
Magical Girl Squad trio.

00:10:51.083 --> 00:10:52.812
Just do as I say.

00:10:53.386 --> 00:10:55.013
Four members?

00:10:55.388 --> 00:10:58.187
How come she knows about Lennon?

00:10:58.557 --> 00:10:59.701
She noticed.

00:10:59.725 --> 00:11:00.783
She noticed.
What?

00:11:00.926 --> 00:11:02.894
That Lennon's not an apprentice witch.

00:11:02.995 --> 00:11:03.438
Huh?

00:11:03.462 --> 00:11:05.089
Huh?
A warlock then?

00:11:05.231 --> 00:11:06.742
Don't compare me to that bunch.

00:11:06.766 --> 00:11:09.326
Don't compare me to that bunch.
A human just like Arusu.

00:11:09.435 --> 00:11:10.664
What?

00:11:12.838 --> 00:11:16.968
I'm not accepted in the Human Realm
nor the Magical Realm.

00:11:18.377 --> 00:11:20.846
| don't belong in either realm.

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:23.339
Nobody wants me.

00:11:32.658 --> 00:11:35.650
Tweeny Witches

00:11:40.199 --> 00:11:44.659
Lennon's True Identity

00:11:47.473 --> 00:11:51.273
People can't decide
where they want to be born.

00:11:52.211 --> 00:11:54.339
No matter where that might be.

00:11:54.447 --> 00:11:57.940
People clench their fists
and cry out loud.

00:11:58.184 --> 00:12:01.119
They have to accept where they're born.

00:12:10.496 --> 00:12:12.658
Now here's a question.

00:12:13.199 --> 00:12:16.999
Why did Atelia summon us here?

00:12:17.503 --> 00:12:18.732
Choice number one.

00:12:18.838 --> 00:12:22.365
Sheila told everyone about
the destruction, so she's mad.

00:12:22.508 --> 00:12:23.805
It was you.

00:12:23.909 --> 00:12:26.503
Number two. She found out
that I had the book!

00:12:26.612 --> 00:12:28.205
It was also you.

00:12:28.314 --> 00:12:31.807
And number three.
She found out who Lennon is.

00:12:31.951 --> 00:12:34.386
| don't think you told that to anyone.

00:12:35.921 --> 00:12:38.947
No matter what happens,
don't let go of the True Book of Spells!

00:12:39.058 --> 00:12:40.992
Even if Atelia asks for it!

00:12:41.127 --> 00:12:43.926
That means you chose number two? Hey!

00:12:44.029 --> 00:12:46.726
Arusu recovered very quickly.

00:12:48.267 --> 00:12:50.827
Sheila and the others are coming in.

00:12:52.404 --> 00:12:53.235
Hello!

00:12:53.639 --> 00:12:57.269
The four members of the
Magical Girl Squad are here!

00:12:58.410 --> 00:12:59.741
What is it?

00:12:59.945 --> 00:13:02.209
The situation has become serious.

00:13:02.648 --> 00:13:05.481
The destruction of the Sanctuary
and the deterioration of our magic...

00:13:05.584 --> 00:13:08.815
The full-scale attack by the warlocks...
the chaos caused by the people...

00:13:08.921 --> 00:13:11.390
But still, I have the
responsibility of protecting...

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:14.152
...the tradition of the witches
until the very end.

00:13:15.561 --> 00:13:18.258
Even if I know it's a useless thing.

00:13:19.832 --> 00:13:25.669
And this is the path I chose
by making many sacrifices.

00:13:27.473 --> 00:13:29.202
That is all.

00:13:29.375 --> 00:13:31.810
Leave the True Book of Spells
and step back.

00:13:31.911 --> 00:13:34.278
We don't have any book like that. Right?

00:13:34.380 --> 00:13:35.211
Yeah.

00:13:35.447 --> 00:13:36.573
Right, Arusu?

00:13:36.682 --> 00:13:39.481
Hey, do you know about light magic?

00:13:40.152 --> 00:13:43.679
Light magic? What are you talking about?

00:13:43.789 --> 00:13:47.521
Are you saying you'll counter
dark magic with light magic?

00:13:47.626 --> 00:13:48.069
That's right!

00:13:48.093 --> 00:13:49.254
That's right!
Are you serious?

00:13:49.328 --> 00:13:50.022
| guess.

00:13:50.296 --> 00:13:51.957
Don't be ridiculous.

00:13:52.064 --> 00:13:54.863
That magic is written only
in the Book of Prophecies.

00:13:54.967 --> 00:13:55.661
No way!

00:13:55.768 --> 00:13:59.534
It was once used by a witch who
is known as a savior in order to...

00:13:59.638 --> 00:14:02.767
...create this realm.
It's considered a legendary magic.

00:14:03.108 --> 00:14:04.234
A savior?

00:14:04.343 --> 00:14:08.905
The True Book of Spells lists
every spell a witch can use.

00:14:09.815 --> 00:14:12.477
You're right. It's not listed here.

00:14:12.618 --> 00:14:15.644
But Wil spoke about the magic of light!

00:14:15.788 --> 00:14:17.256
You know him?

00:14:17.356 --> 00:14:19.723
The wizard of Miche Village named Wil?

00:14:19.825 --> 00:14:20.553
Yeah.

00:14:20.826 --> 00:14:21.725
Atelia!

00:14:23.295 --> 00:14:25.992
I'm not the woman you seek.

00:14:28.234 --> 00:14:31.431
Are you still going to pretend
like you don't know anything?

00:14:31.971 --> 00:14:35.032
If you keep denying it,
then I'll just burn this...

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:38.007
...and make myself and the magic
disappear as well.

00:14:38.510 --> 00:14:43.004
| kept myself alive
all these years to meet you!

00:14:43.549 --> 00:14:45.916
What are you talking about, Lennon?

00:14:46.285 --> 00:14:49.118
She's my mother.

00:14:50.389 --> 00:14:54.292
You abandoned me and my father
so that you could come to power.

00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:55.288
What?

00:14:55.361 --> 00:14:56.590
That was...

00:14:57.062 --> 00:15:01.021
He took you and the True Book of Spells
and fled to the Human Realm.

00:15:01.267 --> 00:15:03.031
To the Human Realm?

00:15:03.168 --> 00:15:06.763
You kicked us out! As if you were
getting rid of a nuisance!

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:08.807
It can't be...

00:15:09.608 --> 00:15:13.602
He was with a little boy who was
probably not old enough to talk.

00:15:14.313 --> 00:15:16.441
| let the man and his boy
get on a ship...

00:15:16.515 --> 00:15:19.007
...and sent him off to the Human Realm.

00:15:19.818 --> 00:15:22.287
Your father can't be...

00:15:23.389 --> 00:15:24.049
Jidan.

00:15:25.858 --> 00:15:28.190
He's your father too, Arusu.

00:15:30.729 --> 00:15:32.891
Arusu! Arusu!

00:15:34.733 --> 00:15:36.633
Please! Get me out of here!

00:15:36.769 --> 00:15:39.466
| have a daughter!
Let me see my daughter!

00:15:41.640 --> 00:15:44.041
It's no use! You know that, don't you?

00:15:44.276 --> 00:15:47.246
Besides, you said
you were looking for your son.

00:15:47.947 --> 00:15:49.472
What's going on?

00:15:53.585 --> 00:15:55.781
It was more than ten years ago.

00:15:56.255 --> 00:16:00.214
| was an archaeologist, and
| arrived on a mysterious island.

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:04.523
| found out about the truth
associated with the...

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:07.065
...crow statue that was
considered to be the...

00:16:07.166 --> 00:16:09.225
...everlasting mystery of mankind.

00:16:09.401 --> 00:16:11.495
I'm sure of it. This must be...

00:16:19.345 --> 00:16:24.146
When I woke up, I was being held
captive in this Magical Realm.

00:16:25.851 --> 00:16:28.183
| always admired magic.

00:16:28.387 --> 00:16:31.413
| want to know the truth
behind magic. Believe me!

00:16:35.461 --> 00:16:36.656
It can't be!

00:16:37.896 --> 00:16:40.661
Then Arusu and Bucky are both...

00:16:40.899 --> 00:16:42.264
Siblings?

00:16:42.501 --> 00:16:45.766
What Lennon is saying is true.

00:16:48.073 --> 00:16:51.338
| was in love with a person once.

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:53.635
And he was a human...

00:16:58.717 --> 00:17:03.314
Under the grand master's orders,
| fought to protect the magic and...

00:17:03.889 --> 00:17:09.191
...to retrieve the True Book of Spells
that was taken by the warlocks.

00:17:14.033 --> 00:17:16.661
Don't worry. We're with the wizards.

00:17:16.769 --> 00:17:18.464
I'll have you out in no time.

00:17:18.637 --> 00:17:20.196
I'm a human.

00:17:20.305 --> 00:17:21.136
What?

00:17:21.607 --> 00:17:25.043
Why do you use your precious magic
to take the lives of warlocks?

00:17:26.478 --> 00:17:28.344
With those words...

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:32.883
...| started to feel shaky about
the values that I truly believed in.

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:41.060
Well? Power to bring smiles
to the ones you care about.

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:42.719
That is magic.

00:17:46.498 --> 00:17:50.628
Then I fell in love with him.
Despite the fact he was human.

00:17:51.336 --> 00:17:53.930
We decided to live secretly
in a small village...

00:17:54.039 --> 00:17:56.303
...isolated from the rest of the world.

00:17:56.575 --> 00:18:00.443
We then had a son and named him Lennon.

00:18:01.246 --> 00:18:02.077
A son?

00:18:02.147 --> 00:18:03.205
A boy?

00:18:03.682 --> 00:18:05.548
What? You didn't know?

00:18:06.919 --> 00:18:12.483
But she couldn't forget the fact
that she was still a witch.

00:18:13.692 --> 00:18:16.457
The True Book of Spells
retrieved by the wizards...

00:18:16.562 --> 00:18:19.190
...had made her realize
who she truly was.

00:18:20.032 --> 00:18:23.764
As long as I have this, the warlocks
won't be able to use dark magic.

00:18:23.869 --> 00:18:25.837
Dark magic is a fierce,
forbidden magic...

00:18:25.938 --> 00:18:28.134
...that can destroy
even the Human Realm.

00:18:28.907 --> 00:18:30.898
I must go back to the
Witch Realm at once...

00:18:31.009 --> 00:18:34.206
...and deliver this True Book of Spells
to the grand master.

00:18:34.313 --> 00:18:38.011
You believe without a doubt that
you're always right and others wrong.

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:41.679
I'm sorry, but
| don't want to argue with you.

00:18:42.721 --> 00:18:44.519
Leave Lennon here with me.

00:18:44.623 --> 00:18:45.556
But...

00:18:48.360 --> 00:18:51.955
| also want to be with you and my son.

00:18:52.097 --> 00:18:54.725
| want to be with you two if I can...

00:18:58.003 --> 00:19:00.870
Because tradition is considered to
be important in the Witch Realm...

00:19:00.973 --> 00:19:02.998
...a human like me
wouldn't belong there.

00:19:03.108 --> 00:19:07.375
On top of that, she wouldn't be able
to bring a son of mixed blood there.

00:19:10.916 --> 00:19:13.351
| wanted to set her free.

00:19:14.786 --> 00:19:18.620
| simply didn't want to turn her magic
into a tool to be used in feuds.

00:19:19.591 --> 00:19:22.322
So I took my son and
the True Book of Spells...

00:19:22.461 --> 00:19:24.930
...which was capable
of causing a feud...

00:19:25.397 --> 00:19:28.765
...to the Human Realm,
where no one could get hold of it.

00:19:32.471 --> 00:19:33.734
Lennon!

00:19:36.241 --> 00:19:40.508
To tell you the truth,
| wanted to be with both of you.

00:19:40.746 --> 00:19:41.577
Liar!

00:19:43.015 --> 00:19:46.076
You abandoned us both!

00:19:47.719 --> 00:19:51.121
You did it to protect your own
interests and to achieve success!

00:19:53.058 --> 00:19:55.618
I'll never forgive you!

00:19:57.629 --> 00:20:01.930
People can't decide
where they want to be born.

00:20:03.101 --> 00:20:05.968
| can't guarantee that I was never...

00:20:06.705 --> 00:20:08.002
...like him.

00:20:17.115 --> 00:20:25.079
Come on, let's go!
Without closing our eyes...

00:20:25.257 --> 00:20:33.257
Our singing and laughter
fill the vast sky.

00:20:34.499 --> 00:20:42.499
We're headed for
our greatest longings.

00:20:43.709 --> 00:20:49.273
There's no wish
that can't come true.

00:20:49.381 --> 00:20:53.648
Let's just believe and fly away!

00:20:54.386 --> 00:20:58.619
No matter how hopeless it seems...
If we wish hard enough...

00:20:58.724 --> 00:21:03.321
See, it'll turn info magic.

00:21:03.528 --> 00:21:08.694
Even the tiniest dream...
If it can bring somebody joy...

00:21:08.800 --> 00:21:11.861
Let's hope it does.

00:21:13.438 --> 00:21:17.932
Hey! DuDiDuWa...
We're laughing always, lalala...

00:21:18.043 --> 00:21:20.535
Let's sing your song and
smile and laugh with me.

00:21:20.646 --> 00:21:28.646
The truth is we're all waiting...

00:21:29.855 --> 00:21:35.555
...for the world of our dreams.

00:21:35.661 --> 00:21:39.859
So we might as well
Just make one of our own!
